[00:00.00]Dear Professor Alexander,
[00:02.50]On behalf of all the students at my university who share a love for the English language,
[00:10.43]I cordially invite you to give a lecture at Beijing Foreign Studies University.
[00:17.72]As you are one of the leading experts in the English language study all over the world,
[00:25.44]I believe that the students will not only be able to learn a lot from you,
